<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 8.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 8.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Schroder Intl	  10.65    2.26</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.32    0.95</p>
<p> 3   Villa World	     9.73    1.13</p>
